---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing | Panhandle Headlight Restoration"
  description="Three coating tiers: Clear ($80 car / $100 truck, 6-mo), Clear Pro ($100 / $125, 12-mo), Clear Shield ($120 / $150, 18-mo). Military and first-responder discounts. Free within 30 mi of Marianna."
>
  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Simple pricing</span>
      <h2>Pick your protection level.</h2>
      <p>Prices are per pair of headlights. Cars start at the base price. Trucks, SUVs, and vans have larger lenses and take longer &mdash; they run $20 to $30 more per pair. Severe oxidation adds $15 to $30 to any tier, quoted on-site before we start.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tiers">
      <div class="tier">
        <h3>Clear</h3>
        <div class="price">$80<small> / pair &middot; car</small></div>
        <div class="price-alt">$100 / pair &middot; truck or SUV</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Wet sand &amp; polish</li>
          <li>3M professional clear coat</li>
          <li>Best for light to medium haze</li>
          <li>6-month guarantee</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="tel:+18505836322">Book Clear</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tier">
        <h3>Clear Pro</h3>
        <div class="price">$100<small> / pair &middot; car</small></div>
        <div class="price-alt">$125 / pair &middot; truck or SUV</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Wet sand &amp; polish</li>
          <li>Delta Kits Infinity liquid coat</li>
          <li>Thicker film, UV stabilizers</li>
          <li>12-month guarantee</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="tel:+18505836322">Book Clear Pro</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tier feature">
        <span class="flag">Best protection</span>
        <h3>Clear Shield</h3>
        <div class="price">$120<small> / pair &middot; car</small></div>
        <div class="price-alt">$150 / pair &middot; truck or SUV</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Wet sand &amp; polish</li>
          <li>GlasWeld COAT UV-cured hard coat</li>
          <li>UV-lamp cured&mdash;bonds to the lens</li>
          <li>18-month guarantee</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+18505836322">Book Clear Shield</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="discount-banner">Military, Veterans, Law Enforcement, First Responders, and School Employees: <strong>10% off</strong> any tier. Just show valid ID at your appointment.</p>
    <p class="fineprint">Free mobile service within about 30 miles of Marianna. 30 to 50 miles: a $25 trip fee. Beyond 50 miles (wider Panhandle, South Alabama, Southwest Georgia): a travel surcharge applies, and multi-vehicle or dealer batches are preferred. Fleet pricing (per vehicle): Clear $50 car / $65 truck-SUV; Clear Pro $65 / $85; Clear Shield $80 / $105. Condition upcharge (+$15 moderate, +$30 severe) applies to all tiers when needed, quoted on-site before work begins. One discount per job; discounts apply to retail work and do not stack. Prices subject to applicable Florida sales tax.</p>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
